sequenceDiagram
  box System Value
    actor ReceptionClerk as 👤 医事課 受付担当
  end
  box System Boundary
    participant PatientProfileScreen as 🖥️ Patient Profile Screen
  end
  box System
    participant System as 🧩 システム
    participant PatientAccount as 🗄️ Patient Account
  end

  Note over ReceptionClerk,PatientAccount: ✅ Archive Patient
  ReceptionClerk->System: ✅ Archive Patient
  activate System
